## Attribution

GateClaw is a heavily modified fork of [OpenCode](https://github.com/opencode-ai/opencode).
The original OpenCode project is released under the MIT License.

This project includes substantial modifications including:
- Telegram bot integration
- Persistent memory system (SQLite)
- SOUL.md personality architecture
- Daemon orchestration layer
- Multi-interface support (TUI, CLI, Telegram, Web, HTTP API)
- Voice integration (pocket-tts-server)
- Platform-specific configurations (Windows, Linux, macOS)

